                                                "sense_id": "3ce62f19-84f1-32f5-a286-9dbd6d04f283",
                                                "text": "\"I really,\" returned the other with a sneer, \"cannot agree about probabilities or improbabilities, but I know what the generality will think when they see a gentleman constantly with five very pretty girls, and I also know what they will say.\""
